    {
      "id": "claim_2c717760565b4e668c14d16a6171f006",
      "statement": "The cache-core serialization stack mixes Jackson generations deliberately: CacheKey.MAPPER is a Jackson 3 tools.jackson.databind.json.JsonMapper built with JsonMapper.builderWithJackson2Defaults() and SerializationFeature.INDENT_OUTPUT, while the @JsonIgnore that hides localKey from toJsonKey() comes from com.fasterxml.jackson.annotation (Jackson annotations 2.x); after the Jackson 3 migration both are direct pom dependencies, so the 2.x annotations remain effective for the new databind.",
      "evidence": [
