      "id": "claim_2821984c257148c099476dd42c3f573a",
      "statement": "The Redis-based backends read their connection settings from the EnvironmentProvider that Cache.createByType forwards: RedisCache reads REDIS_URL (default redis://localhost:6379), RestRedisCache reads REST_REDIS_URI (default http://localhost:8080) plus REST_REDIS_USERNAME/REST_REDIS_PASSWORD, and both constructors fail fast with IllegalStateException when the ping to the configured endpoint fails.",
      "evidence": [
