      "statement": "CacheKeySerializationTest pins the exact serialized byte form of the cache keys: it asserts byte-stable expected JSON for a chat key (with escaping-sensitive content) and an embedding key (seed/temperature pinned to -1, mode EMBEDDING), because the JSON key is the Redis hash address and any change in property order, escaping, or whitespace invalidates all existing caches.",
